        "updatedAt": "2026-03-26T21:22:28.507Z",
        "changeLog": "Updated tonemapping - Returned to luminance display mapping. Switched to max channel tonemapping for LUT sampling."
      },
      "current": {
        "modVersion": "2.0",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.4.0.1",
        "fileName": "renodx-worldoftanks-wgmods_2jgWZqb.7z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-22T10:44:53.335Z",
        "changeLog": "* Tonemapping overhaul - New extended tonemapper implementation, and now ran in LMS instead of BT.709.\n* Color grading overhaul - Luminance-based adjustments are now applied before tonemapping.\n* Display Mapping is now done using Neutwo per-channel in LMS instead of RenoDRT by luminance. The \"RenoDRT\" label has now been renamed to \"Vanilla+ (HDR)\"\n* Support for lower graphics settings - Output shaders change depending on the lighting quality setting. Previously the mod was made using only Ultra as a reference, but I've added the shaders for lower settings now."
      }
